  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zimbabwe Humanitarian Response 2015/17</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve availability of basic food needs to the most vulnerable and drought affected households in 15 districts of Masvingo, Midlands, Matebeleland North and Matebeleland South provinces through cash transfers to individual households. The programme will benefit up to 336,000 of the most vulnerable and at risk women, girls, men and boys.</narrative>
  </description>
